                            <comment id="17832564" author="jueyi" created="Sun, 31 Mar 2024 09:34:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fix Design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In `kylinSecurity.xml`, the value injected through `${kylin.security.acl.admin-role}` is garbled. The key is to solve the problem of garbled Chinese characters here.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The injection of property values in XML through `${}` is implemented by Spring. To address this, modify the `org.apache.kylin.rest.security.PasswordPlaceholderConfigurer` class by adding the following line of code:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;this&lt;/span&gt;.setFileEncoding(Charset.defaultCharset().toString());&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17836523" author="JIRAUSER294653" created="Fri, 12 Apr 2024 09:31:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Resolved by commit: 07354967d424f3ba76d87ea562948f8b5f69a3a5&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
